{"id":"forecast-12","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-12/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":331.42,"segments":[{"start":3.06,"end":9.98,"text":"You will hear the organiser of a family camp talking to a group of people who will be staying","words":[["You",3.06,3.74],["will",3.74,4.42],["hear",4.42,4.68],["the",4.68,4.88],["organiser",4.88,5.56],["of",5.56,5.8],["a",5.8,5.9],["family",5.9,6.3],["camp",6.3,6.8],["talking",6.8,7.66],["to",7.66,7.94],["a",7.94,8.06],["group",8.06,8.28],["of",8.28,8.48],["people",8.48,8.8],["who",8.8,9.22],["will",9.22,9.36],["be",9.36,9.52],["staying",9.52,9.98]]},{"start":9.98,"end":48.36,"text":"at a campsite. First you have some time to look at questions 11-16 on page 3. Now listen","words":[["at",9.98,10.22],["a",10.22,10.34],["campsite.",10.34,10.92],["First",11.64,12.16],["you",12.16,12.84],["have",12.84,13.02],["some",13.02,13.22],["time",13.22,13.54],["to",13.54,13.76],["look",13.76,13.88],["at",13.88,14.04],["questions",14.04,14.36],["11",14.36,15.04],["-16",15.04,15.82],["on",15.82,16.58],["page",16.58,16.9],["3.",16.9,17.44],["Now",47.86,48.06],["listen",48.06,48.36]]},{"start":48.36,"end":51.62,"text":"carefully and answer questions 11-16.","words":[["carefully",48.36,48.78],["and",48.78,49.56],["answer",49.56,49.84],["questions",49.84,50.18],["11",50.18,50.84],["-16.",50.84,51.62]]},{"start":54.87,"end":62.09,"text":"Hello everyone and welcome to this orientation session prior to our camp next week. Thank","words":[["Hello",54.87,55.53],["everyone",55.53,56.07],["and",56.07,56.85],["welcome",56.85,57.25],["to",57.25,57.53],["this",57.53,57.69],["orientation",57.69,58.29],["session",58.29,59.01],["prior",59.01,59.75],["to",59.75,60.03],["our",60.03,60.19],["camp",60.19,60.47],["next",60.47,60.81],["week.",60.81,61.11],["Thank",61.77,62.09]]},{"start":62.09,"end":67.09,"text":"you for coming along to find out what you and your children will be doing on this year's camp.","words":[["you",62.09,62.29],["for",62.29,62.45],["coming",62.45,62.69],["along",62.69,63.09],["to",63.09,63.51],["find",63.51,63.81],["out",63.81,64.09],["what",64.09,64.31],["you",64.31,64.65],["and",64.65,64.91],["your",64.91,65.11],["children",65.11,65.51],["will",65.51,65.75],["be",65.75,65.89],["doing",65.89,66.21],["on",66.21,66.39],["this",66.39,66.57],["year's",66.57,66.85],["camp.",66.85,67.09]]},{"start":67.95,"end":73.73,"text":"To start off with, let's tell you a bit about the campsite itself, so that you'll be able to","words":[["To",67.95,68.31],["start",68.31,68.53],["off",68.53,68.81],["with,",68.81,69.03],["let's",69.43,69.85],["tell",69.85,70.03],["you",70.03,70.21],["a",70.21,70.35],["bit",70.35,70.43],["about",70.43,70.73],["the",70.73,70.91],["campsite",70.91,71.47],["itself,",71.47,71.99],["so",72.47,72.83],["that",72.83,73.03],["you'll",73.03,73.21],["be",73.21,73.33],["able",73.33,73.57],["to",73.57,73.73]]},{"start":73.73,"end":80.01,"text":"find your way around once you get there. Firstly, we'll be arriving by bus into the car park,","words":[["find",73.73,74.01],["your",74.01,74.21],["way",74.21,74.41],["around",74.41,74.85],["once",74.85,75.07],["you",75.07,75.27],["get",75.27,75.41],["there.",75.41,75.73],["Firstly,",76.61,77.09],["we'll",77.51,77.77],["be",77.77,77.89],["arriving",77.89,78.27],["by",78.27,78.71],["bus",78.71,79.07],["into",79.07,79.39],["the",79.39,79.55],["car",79.55,79.73],["park,",79.73,80.01]]},{"start":80.51,"end":85.07,"text":"which if you look at the plan you have in front of you, you'll see at the top of the picture","words":[["which",80.51,80.87],["if",80.87,81.17],["you",81.17,81.33],["look",81.33,81.47],["at",81.47,81.61],["the",81.61,81.71],["plan",81.71,82.03],["you",82.03,82.23],["have",82.23,82.37],["in",82.37,82.53],["front",82.53,82.73],["of",82.73,82.91],["you,",82.91,83.13],["you'll",83.43,83.79],["see",83.79,84.01],["at",84.01,84.11],["the",84.11,84.23],["top",84.23,84.51],["of",84.51,84.65],["the",84.65,84.75],["picture",84.75,85.07]]},{"