["what",236.24,236.44]]},{"start":236.44,"end":242.66,"text":"you need to pack. The lake is a bit cold for swimming at this time of year so you can","words":[["you",236.44,236.64],["need",236.64,236.76],["to",236.76,236.94],["pack.",236.94,237.22],["The",238.34,238.66],["lake",238.66,239.0],["is",239.0,239.38],["a",239.38,239.5],["bit",239.5,239.68],["cold",239.68,240.1],["for",240.1,240.34],["swimming",240.34,240.62],["at",240.62,240.82],["this",240.82,241.0],["time",241.0,241.24],["of",241.24,241.4],["year",241.4,241.64],["so",241.64,242.3],["you",242.3,242.5],["can",242.5,242.66]]},{"start":242.66,"end":248.3,"text":"leave your togs out of the suitcase. While we're on the subject of weather too, usually","words":[["leave",242.66,242.84],["your",242.84,243.0],["togs",243.0,243.32],["out",243.32,243.52],["of",243.52,243.62],["the",243.62,243.74],["suitcase.",243.74,244.02],["While",245.18,245.68],["we're",245.68,245.9],["on",245.9,246.02],["the",246.02,246.14],["subject",246.14,246.56],["of",246.56,246.78],["weather",246.78,247.02],["too,",247.02,247.34],["usually",247.8,248.3]]},{"start":248.3,"end":252.9,"text":"I recommend that campers bring sunblock with them, but I guess now that we're","words":[["I",248.3,248.68],["recommend",248.68,249.12],["that",249.12,249.36],["campers",249.36,249.84],["bring",249.84,250.08],["sunblock",250.08,250.7],["with",250.7,250.96],["them,",250.96,251.18],["but",251.48,251.98],["I",251.98,252.2],["guess",252.2,252.38],["now",252.38,252.62],["that",252.62,252.78],["we're",252.78,252.9]]},{"start":252.9,"end":259.6,"text":"into April that too can be left behind. Ah, let me think. Some campers like a","words":[["into",252.9,253.08],["April",253.08,253.4],["that",253.4,253.96],["too",253.96,254.22],["can",254.22,254.38],["be",254.38,254.48],["left",254.48,254.66],["behind.",254.66,255.1],["Ah,",256.3,256.82],["let",257.02,257.18],["me",257.18,257.3],["think.",257.3,257.7],["Some",258.3,258.76],["campers",258.76,259.22],["like",259.22,259.42],["a",259.42,259.6]]},{"start":259.6,"end":264.22,"text":"torch, but actually the days are still so long that it's light outside till quite","words":[["torch,",259.6,259.94],["but",260.36,260.54],["actually",260.54,261.0],["the",261.0,261.2],["days",261.2,261.48],["are",261.48,261.62],["still",261.62,261.78],["so",261.78,262.14],["long",262.14,262.5],["that",262.5,262.66],["it's",262.66,262.84],["light",262.84,263.1],["outside",263.1,263.6],["till",263.6,263.88],["quite",263.88,264.22]]},{"start":264.22,"end":269.66,"text":"late and the blocks all have outside lighting now. So I'd say that a pair of","words":[["late",264.22,264.54],["and",264.54,265.24],["the",265.24,265.36],["blocks",265.36,265.6],["all",265.6,265.9],["have",265.9,266.08],["outside",266.08,266.44],["lighting",266.44,266.82],["now.",266.82,267.14],["So",267.88,268.4],["I'd",268.4,268.78],["say",268.78,269.0],["that",269.0,269.14],["a",269.14,269.28],["pair",269.28,269.44],["of",269.44,269.66]]},{"start":269.66,"end":274.5,"text":"earplugs are more useful as in my experience a lot of talking goes on","words":[["earplugs",269.66,270.34],["are",270.34,270.48],["more",270.48,270.62],["useful",270.62,271.02],["as",271.02,271.76],["in",271.76,271.96],["my",271.96,272.22],["experience",272.22,272.88],["a",272.88,273.22],["lot",273.22,273.42],["of",273.42,273.6],["talking",273.6,273.96],["goes",273.96,274.32],["on",274.32,274.5]]},{"start":274.5,"end":280.98,"text":"after lights out. But in April, if it's wet, it can get muddy around the campsite, so to","words":[["after",274.5,274.8],["lights",274.8,275.06],["out.",275.06,275.44],["But",276.04,276.52],["in",276.52,276.72],["April,",276.72,277.02],["if",277.52,277.72],["it's",277.72,277.92],["wet,",277.92,278.08],["it",278.2,278.32],["can",278.32,278.6],["get",278.6,278.84],["muddy",278.84,279.12],["around",279.12,279.44],["the",279.44,279.6],["campsite,",279.6,280.14],["so",280.4,280.76],["to",280.76,280.98]]},{"start":280.98,"end":282.6,"text":"bring boots isn't a bad idea.","words":[["bring",280.98,281.22],["boots",281.22,281.58],["isn't",281.58,281.94],["a",281.94,282.02],["bad",282.02,282.18],["idea.",282.18,282.6]]},{"start":283.78,"end":290.1,"text":"Finally, can you all please prepare something for the final night concert? Bring your musical","words":[["Finally,",283.78,284.38],["can",284.86,285.1],["you",285.1,285.32],["all",285.32,285.62],["please",285.62,286.04],["prepare",286.04,286.36],["something",286.36,286.84],["for",286.84,287.06],["the",287.06,287.2],["final",287.2,287.58],["night",287.58,287.94],["concert?",287.94,288.4],["Bring",289.18,289.52],["your",289.52,289.7],["musical",289.7,290.1]]},{"start":290.1,"end":295.26,"text":"instruments or whatever else you need. You can't have a camp without a good sing-along.","words":[["instruments",290.1,290.64],["or",290.64,291.06],["whatever",291.06,291.36],["else",291.36,291.78],["you",291.78,291.9],["need.",291.9,292.12],["You",292.74,293.0],["can't",293.0,293.4],["have",293.4,293.58],["a",293.58,293.74],["camp",293.74,293.94],["without",293.94,294.18],["a",294.18,294.42],["good",294.42,294.62],["sing",294.62,294.96],["-along.",294.96,295.26]]},{"start":295.58,"end":301.98,"text":"That's our favourite activity. Maybe you could recite a poem, act out a skit or charades","words":[["That's",295.58,295.84],["our",295.84,295.98],["favourite",295.98,296.28],["activity.",296.28,296.84],["Maybe",297.78,298.24],["you",298.24,298.46],["could",298.46,298.66],["recite",298.66,299.06],["a",299.06,299.22],["poem,",299.22,299.56],["act",300.22,300.48],["out",300.48,300.7],["a",300.7,300.82],["skit",300.82,301.16],["or",301.16,301.44],["charades",301.44,301.98]]},{"start":301.98,"end":307.1,"text":"for us if you're brave enough to try that. Or failing that, perhaps you can tell a joke","words":[["for",301.98,302.2],["us",302.2,302.4],["if",302.4,302.58],["you're",302.58,302.78],["brave",302.78,302.94],["enough",302.94,303.18],["to",303.18,303.36],["try",303.36,303.6